rtAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="35"><CHAR>예상 출력 데이터 및 관찰점</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="8674" Height="12600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>STC-MON-001 / </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>R06, R08, R11</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="8192" Height="12600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>PC 연결부터 백</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>업·해제까지</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="15420" Height="12600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>/monitor.html에서 미동의 연결 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>시도 후 기본·Sysmon 동의. 이름</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR> Synthetic test PC. 스키마 1.2.0, </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>CPU 평균 48, 가용 메모리 8192</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>MB, 커밋 60%, 디스크 큐 0.2, 온</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>도 null인 합성 스냅샷 2개를 업</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>로드. 다른 브라우저에서 조회키 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>백업 복구 후 연결 해제</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="3" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="15904" Height="12600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>미동의 안내. 설정 파일 다운로드,</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR> 전송키 형식 확인. 48.0%, 8.0 GB,</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR> 확인 못함, ‘수신 중’ 표시. 그래프</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR> 선 2개. 복구 후 같은 수치. 삭제 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>후 기존 전송키 업로드 HTTP 401.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR> PC·프로세스 문자열의 HTML이 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>실행되지 않음. 390px 화면에서 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>가로 넘침 없음</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="8674" Height="8100" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>STC-SEC-002 / R</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>08</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="8192" Height="8100" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>견적 입력의 DO</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>M 삽입 방지</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="15420" Height="8100" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>javascript:alert(1) URL, 부품 cate</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>gory=&lt;img src=x onerror=bad(</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>)&gt;, name=&lt;svg onload=bad()&gt;,</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR> status=&lt;script&gt;bad()&lt;/script&gt;</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>를 가격 비교 표에 전달</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="3" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="15904" Height="8100" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>위험 URL은 #. 표 내부 img/svg/s</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>cript 요소 0개. 입력 문자는 실행</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>되지 않음</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="8674" Height="6600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>STC-MON-003 / </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>R05, R06</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="8192" Height="6600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARA