eBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>기본 1365×1000, 모바일 점검 390×844, headless 모드, worker 1</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="11083" Height="3600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>웹 시험 서버</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="37107" Height="3600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>http://127.0.0.1:8031, SERVE_FRONTEND=true, TELEMETRY_API_ENABLED=false,</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR> MONITORING_ENABLED=true</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="11083" Height="3600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>격리 설정</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="37107" Height="3600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>Backend 시험은 MONITOR_TEST_DATABASE_URL 비움. fixture가 로컬 SQLite와 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>모드를 지정. 브라우저 DB는 실행별 .deployment-tmp/ui-monitor-* 경로</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="7" RowSpan="1" Width="11083" Height="3600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>외부 호출 설정</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="7" RowSpan="1" Width="37107" Height="3600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>브라우저 시험의 네이버/OpenAI 키 비움. 상품·판매처 응답은 시험 코드에서 대</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>체. 실제 LLM 시험 미실시</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="8" RowSpan="1" Width="11083" Height="2100" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>로그 형식</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="8" RowSpan="1" Width="37107" Height="2100" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>pytest JUnit XML, 실행 텍스트 로그, Playwright JSON 및 PNG 캡처</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="37" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="41"><CHAR /></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>위 버전은 이번 시험에서 사용한 값이다. 배포 설정의 Python 3.12·Node 22 기반 CI와 로컬 Node 버전은 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>다르며, CI 작업의 원격 성공 여부를 이번 로컬 결과로 대체하지 않는다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="37" Style="0" PageBreak="true" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="41"><CHAR /></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="36"><CHAR>6. 테스트 결과</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="37" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="41"><CHAR /></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>판정 기호는 P=예상 결과 일치, F=예상 결과 불일치, NT=미실시다. 정정여부는 해당 제품 동작을 수정한 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>뒤 재시험했는지 표시한다. 이번 최종 실행은 제품 코드 변경 없이 수행했다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="35"><CHAR>표 10. 시스템 수준 브라우저 시험 결과</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="37" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><TABLE BorderFill="4" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="7" RowCount="8" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatH