tyle="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>backend-tests-final.xml / 실행</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR> 로그</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="22168" Height="3600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>Backend 113개 항목 최종 결과</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="11565" Height="3600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>E03</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="14457" Height="3600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>browser-tests-edge.json / 실</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>행 로그</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="22168" Height="3600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>브라우저 6개 항목 최종 결과. 시작 시각 2026-1</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>1-05 14:12:06 KST</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="11565" Height="3600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>E04</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="14457" Height="3600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>시험 근거 목록</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="22168" Height="3600" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>모든 자동화 항목 이름·결과 및 최초 환경 오류 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>구분</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="11565" Height="2100" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>E05</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="14457" Height="2100" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>모니터링 데스크톱 / 모바일</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="22168" Height="2100" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>STC-MON-001 실행 캡처</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="11565" Height="2100" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>E06</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="14457" Height="2100" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>구매 데스크톱 / 모바일</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="22168" Height="2100" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Protect="false"><CELLMARGIN Left="280" Right="280" Top="300" Bottom="300" /><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>STC-BUY-004 실행 캡처</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="37" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="41"><CHAR /></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="37"><CHAR>7.2 재현 방법</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="37" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="41"><CHAR /></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>명령은 프로젝트 루트에서 실행한다. 이미 사용된 --basetemp 디렉터리를 재사용하지 않도록 실행별 새 이</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>름을 지정한다. 예시는 날짜 뒤에 rerun01을 붙였다. 시험 DB는 운영 DB와 분리한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>$testPython = (Resolve-Path '.deployment-tmp/venv-py312/Scripts/python.exe').Path</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>$testRoot = (Get-Location).Path</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>$env:MONITOR_TEST_DATABASE_URL = ''</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>$env:TELEMETRY_API_ENABLED = 'true'</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>$env:LLM_ENABLED = 'false'</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR /></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>Push-Location agent</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>&amp; $testPython -X utf8 -m pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>  --basetemp="$testRoot/outputs/reports/evidence/tmp-agent-rerun01" </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>  --junitxml="$testRoot/outputs/reports/evidence/agent-rerun01.xml"</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>Pop-Location</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR /></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>Push-Location backend</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>&amp; $testPython -X utf8 -m pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>  --basetemp="$testRoot/outputs/reports/evidence/tmp-backend-rerun01" </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>  --junitxml="$testRoot/outputs/reports/evidence/backend-rerun01.xml"</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>Pop-Location</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR /></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>$env:SPECCHECK_TEST_PYTHON = $testPython</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>$env:MONITOR_TEST_BROWSER = 'msedge'</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>$env:PLAYWRIGHT_JSON_OUTPUT_NAME = "$testRoot/outputs/reports/evidence/browser-rerun01.json"</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>Push-Location frontend/tests</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="37" Style="0" PageBreak="true" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="41"><CHAR /></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>7.2 재현 방법 (계속)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>node node_modules/@playwright/test/cli.js test --reporter=line,json </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>  --output=../../outputs/reports/evidence/browser-rerun01</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR>Pop-Location</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="37" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="41"><CHAR /></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>다른 PC에서는 backend/requirements-web.txt 및 pytest 8.2.0을 갖춘 Python 3.12 환경과 frontend/tests/p</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>ackage-lock.json의 Node 의존성을 준비한다. 실제 시험 소스의 fixture·환경변수·Playwright webServer 설정</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>을 함께 확인한다. 이 예시는 운영 서비스 시작·배포 명령이 아니다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="37"><CHAR>7.3 요구사항 및 소스 추적</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="37" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="41"><CHAR /></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>• 요구사항 분류는 표 1을 사용한다. D04의 공식 요구사항 식별자를 확보하면 SC-Rxx와 매핑한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>• API 입력·응답은 backend/app/schemas/, 공개 권한 경계는 backend/app/api/routes/monitoring.py 및 m</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>ain.py를 따른다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>• 진단 판정은 backend/app/diagnosis/engine.py와 rules/를 따른다. 19개 규칙 목록은 D08 부록 표 5에 수</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>록한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>• 실행 화면과 시험 이름의 대응은 E04에 수록한다. 스크린샷만으로 모든 assertion 통과를 판정하지 않고 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>러너 결과를 함께 사용한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>• 원본 양식의 예시 인명·주가변동 안내시스템·구형 서버 제원은 SpecCheck 사실 정보로 사용하지 않았다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="37"><CHAR>7.4 실행 화면</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="37" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="41"><CHAR /></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="37" Style="0" PageBreak="true" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="41"><CHAR /></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>7.4 실행 화면 (계속)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="38" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><PICTURE Reverse="false"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="400023" Lock="false" NumberingType="Figure" ZOrder="4"><SIZE Height="45000" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="31180" WidthRelTo="Absolute" /><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para" /><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0" /><SHAPECOMMENT>monitor-desktop.png</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SHAPECOMPONENT CurHeight="45000" CurWidth="31180" GroupLevel="0" HorzFlip="false" InstID="1400023" OriHeight="147750" OriWidth="102375" VertFlip="false" XPos="0" YPos="0"><ROTATIONINFO Angle="0" CenterX="15590" CenterY="22500" Rotate="1" /><RENDERINGINFO><TRANSMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000" /><SCAMATRIX E1="0.3045665445665446" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="0.30456852791878175" E6="0.00000" /><ROTMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000" /></RENDERINGINFO></SHAPECOMPONENT><IMAGERECT X0="0" X1="102375" X2="102375" X3="0" Y0="0" Y1="0" Y2="147750" Y3="147750" /><IMAGECLIP Bottom="147750" Left="0" Right="102375" Top="0" /><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0" /><IMAGEDIM Height="147750" Width="102375" /><IMAGE Alpha="0" BinItem="2" Bright="0" Contrast="0" Effect="RealPic" /><EFFECTS /></PICTURE></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="35"><CHAR>그림 2. STC-MON-001 모니터링 실행 화면. 로컬 서버에 합성 JSON을 전송한 화면이다. CPU 48%, 가용 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="35"><CHAR>메모리 8GB, 온도 결측이 표시된다. 일부 필드의 HTML 모양 문자열은 XSS 방어 시험 데이터이며 실제 프</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="35"><CHAR>로그램명·개인 PC 정보가 아니다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="37" Style="0" PageBreak="true" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="41"><CHAR /></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>7.4 실행 화면 (계속)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="38" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><PICTURE Reverse="false"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="400024" Lock="false" NumberingType="Figure" ZOrder="4"><SIZE Height="45000" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="44543" WidthRelTo="Absolute" /><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para" /><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0" /><SHAPECOMMENT>purchase-desktop.png</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SHAPECOMPONENT CurHeight="45000" CurWidth="44543" GroupLevel="0" HorzFlip="false" InstID="1400024" OriHeight="103425" OriWidth="102375" VertFlip="false" XPos="0" YPos="0"><ROTATIONINFO Angle="0" CenterX="22271" CenterY="22500" Rotate="1" /><RENDERINGINFO><TRANSMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000" /><SCAMATRIX E1="0.4350964590964591" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="0.43509789702683105" E6="0.00000" /><ROTMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000" /></RENDERINGINFO></SHAPECOMPONENT><IMAGERECT X0="0" X1="102375" X2="102375" X3="0" Y0="0" Y1="0" Y2="103425" Y3="103425" /><IMAGECLIP Bottom="103425" Left="0" Right="102375" Top="0" /><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0" /><IMAGEDIM Height="103425" Width="102375" /><IMAGE Alpha="0" BinItem="3" Bright="0" Contrast="0" Effect="RealPic" /><EFFECTS /></PICTURE></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="35"><CHAR>그림 3. STC-BUY-004 구매 실행 화면. HDD 진단 문맥에서 SSD 상품으로 이동한 화면이다. 99,000원과 판</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="35"><CHAR>매처는 모의 응답이다. 실제 판매 가격·재고·외부 쇼핑몰 결제 완료를 의미하지 않는다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="37"><CHAR>7.5 제출 전 입력 및 검토 항목</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="37" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="41"><CHAR /></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>• 개인정보 입력란은 공란으로 유지한다. 우태현은 Agent 개발 및 원격 탐지 개선, 김형진은 웹 디자인·개발 총괄을 담당한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>• 작성자·시험 검토자와 최종 승인일을 입력한다. 실제 검토를 수행하지 않은 사람의 서명을 임의로 기재하</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>지 않는다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>• 2026년 11월 17일 종료 시점의 소스·추가 시험·OBS 조치 결과를 반영하고, 최종 검토 결과를 확정한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="true" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>2026-11-09 추가 검증 결과</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>본 추가 기록은 2026-11-05 기준 본문의 OBS-01~02 및 실환경 미검증 상태를 갱신한다. 전체 시스템의 운</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>영 인수 완료 판정은 아니다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>견적 화면: 실제 /api/evaluate-build 계산값과 호환성 메시지를 상세 화면에 연결했다. 등록 벤치마크와 현</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>재 PC 실측을 구분하며 미등록 모델 점수는 표시하지 않는다. 가격 조회 성공값을 보존하고 예시 가격 대체 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>및 시장 조사 예시 게시글·평판을 제거했다. 후보 가격 미입력 시 적용을 차단한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>실기기: Windows 11 Basic Scan, 로컬 업로드 201 및 하드웨어 원본·조회값 일치를 확인했다. hardware/reli</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>ability/performance는 ok였으며 보호된 수집 항목과 일부 분석은 partial로 유지했다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>통합: 실제 Agent 데이터를 로컬 HTTPS와 Docker PostgreSQL 17에 전송하고 Edge에서 실제 측정값을 확</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>인했다. 인증서 검증, Backend·DB 재시작 후 이력 유지, 연결 삭제 및 조회키 차단을 확인했다. 공개 서버·외</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>부 네트워크 검증으로 확대 해석하지 않는다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>회귀: Node UI 시험 53건, 견적·조립 브라우저 시험 5건, 실제 PostgreSQL 모니터링 시험 15건 통과. lint 통</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>과. 조립에서 보드→CPU→쿨러 순서 및 역순 해제를 확인하고 종속 부품이 남은 상태의 보드 해제를 차단했</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>남은 항목: Sysmon 접근 권한 부족, eBay 제공자 키 미설정, Ollama 실행 모델 부재로 실제 이벤트·상품·중</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>고시세·커뮤니티·LLM 시험은 미완료다. 공개 운영 HTTPS/PostgreSQL, 애플리케이션 Docker 이미지, 다기기</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR> 장시간 부하는 별도 검증이 필요하다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>세부 증빙과 재현 명령: docs/validation-2026-11-09.md. 실제 원문·캡처·임시 연결키는 Git 제외 경로 .depl</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="35" Style="0" PageBreak="false" ColumnBreak="false"><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>oyment-tmp에 보관한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P></SECTION></BODY><TAIL><BINDATASTORAGE><BINDATA Compress="false" Encoding="Base64" Id="1" Size="49638"></BINDATA><BINDATA Compress="false" Encoding="Base64" Id="2" Size="224149"></BINDATA><BINDATA Compress="false" Encoding="Base64" Id="3" Size="148059"></BINDATA></BINDATASTORAGE></TAIL></HWPML>